# Saved image tarballs from ship.sh. Sending them as build context put every past release
# into each new build (15 GB) and exhausted memory before the build began.
dist-image
# Model files: the image fetches its own in a stage keyed on the manifest, so sending
# the local copies as context would only add a few hundred MB to every build.
models/*
!models/manifest.json
